==In the TCG==
[[File:YoungsterScarletViolet198.jpg|200px|thumb|Youngster in the TCG]]
{{main|Youngster (Scarlet & Violet 198)}}
'''Youngster''' was introduced as a {{TCG|Supporter card}} in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]] during the English Scarlet & Violet Series (the Japanese Scarlet & Violet Era). It was first released in the Japanese {{TCG|ex Starter Sets}} and the English {{TCG|Scarlet & Violet}} expansion, with artwork by [[Hitoshi Ariga]]. It lets the player shuffle their hand into their deck, and draw five cards.
{{-}}

==Trivia==
* In [[Pokémon GO]], "Youngster" is the name of an achievement {{GO|medal}} awarded for catching at least 3 tiny {{p|Rattata}}.
* In [[Pokémon Champions]], the title of "Youngster" is awarded for winning ten battles using {{type|Normal}} Pokémon.

